":"he of Vallār town","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாய்வாள்","parts":[{"text":"வாய்மை","lemma":"vāy","gloss":"sharpness"},{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"vāḷ","gloss":"sword"}],"gloss":"victorious sword"},{"surface":"பண்ணன்","parts":[{"text":"பண்ணன்","lemma":"paṇṇaṉ","gloss":"Paṇṇaṉ"}],"gloss":"Paṇṇaṉ"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உண்ணா","parts":[{"text":"உண்ணா","lemma":"உண்ணா","gloss":"starving"}],"gloss":"starving","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வறுங்கடும்பு","parts":[{"text":"வறுமை","lemma":"vaṟu","gloss":"impoverished"},{"text":"கடும்பு","lemma":"kaṭumpu","gloss":"family"}],"gloss":"impoverished family"},{"surface":"உய்தல்","parts":[{"text":"உய்தல்","lemma":"uy","gloss":"surviving"}],"gloss":"surviving"},{"surface":"வேண்டின்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டின்","lemma":"vēṇṭu","gloss":"if desired"}],"gloss":"if you desire"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னே","parts":[{"text":"இன்னே","lemma":"iṉṉē","gloss":"right now"}],"gloss":"right now"},{"surface":"சென்மதி","parts":[{"text":"சென்மதி","lemma":"சென்மதி","gloss":"please go"}],"gloss":"please go","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நீயே","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"nī","gloss":"you"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"you yourself"},{"surface":"சென்று","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"cel","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone"},{"surface":"அவன்","parts":[{"text":"அவன்","lemma":"avaṉ","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பகைப்புலம்","parts":[{"text":"பகை","lemma":"pakai","gloss":"enemy"},{"text":"புலம்","lemma":"pulam","gloss":"land"}],"gloss":"enemy land"},{"surface":"படரா","parts":[{"text":"படர்","lemma":"paṭar","gloss":"go"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ā","gloss":"before"}],"gloss":"before marching"},{"surface":"அளவை","parts":[{"text":"அளவை","lemma":"aḷavai","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"within the time"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"nī","gloss":"your"}],"gloss":"your"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பசிப்பகை","parts":[{"text":"பசி","lemma":"paci","gloss":"hunger"},{"text":"பகை","lemma":"pakai","gloss":"enemy"}],"gloss":"hunger-enemy"},{"surface":"பரிசில்","parts":[{"text":"பரிசில்","lemma":"paricil","gloss":"gift"}],"gloss":"gift"},{"surface":"காட்டினை","parts":[{"text":"காட்டினை","lemma":"காட்டினை","gloss":"having shown"}],"gloss":"having shown","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொளற்கே","parts":[{"text":"கொளற்கு","lemma":"koḷ","gloss":"to receive"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"to receive"}]}],"literal":"Of the common ground's wood-apple tree, the house-fallen wood-apple fruit, / with the dark-eyed hunter woman's beloved son, / the forest's dark female elephant's calf grabs / in the dry-land settlement surrounded by large strongholds, / with flesh-smelling arrows and a defensive forest difficult to wage war against, / he of Vallār town, Paṇṇaṉ of the victorious sword. / If you desire your starving, impoverished family to survive, / go right now, you yourself, and having gone, / before he marches to the enemy's land, / to show your hunger-enemy and receive the gift!","translation":"In the dry-land settlement surrounded by large strongholds, the calf of a dark forest elephant and the beloved son of a dark-eyed hunter woman play together, grabbing the wood-apple fruits that have fallen near the house from the tree in the common ground. This is the domain of Paṇṇaṉ of the victorious sword, the lord of Vallār, which is protected by a defensive forest difficult to attack and by warriors with blood-stained arrows. If you wish for your starving, impoverished family to survive, go to him right now! Go before he marches off to the enemy's land, so that you may show him your enemy—hunger—and receive the gift that will destroy it.","modern":"மன்றத்தில் உள்ள விளா மரத்திலிருந்து வீட்டின் அருகே விழுந்த விளாம்பழத்தை, கரிய கண்களைக் கொண்ட எயிற்றி தன் அன்பான மகனுடனும், காட்டில் வாழும் கரிய பெண் யானையின் கன்றுடனும் சேர்ந்து விளையாடிப் பறித்துக் கொள்ளும். இத்தகைய பெரிய அரண்களைக் கொண்ட வன்புலத்து இருக்கையையும், புலால் நாற்றமடிக்கும் அம்புகளையும், போரிடற்கரிய காவல் காட்டையும் உடைய வல்லார் என்னும் ஊருக்குத் தலைவன், கூர்மையான வாளையுடைய பண்ணன் ஆவான். உண்ண உணவின்றித் தவிக்கும் உனது வறிய சுற்றம் பிழைக்க வேண்டும் என்று நீ விரும்பினால், நீ இப்போதே அவனிடம் செல்வாயாக! அவன் பகைவருடைய நாட்டின் மீது படையெடுத்துச் செல்வதற்கு முன்னதாகவே நீ சென்று, உனது பசி என்னும் பகையைக் காட்டி, அதனைப் போக்கும் பரிசிலைப் பெற்றுக்கொள்வாயாக!","explanation":"This poem is set in the Vākai tiṇai and the Vallāṇmullai tuṟai, which praises the greatness and generosity of a warrior-chieftain. The poet, Mukaiyalūrc Ciṟukarun Tumpiyār, is addressing a needy bard, advising him to seek the patronage of Vallār Kiḻāṉ Paṇṇaṉ. The poem opens with a vivid description of Vallār, where a wild elephant calf and a hunter's child peacefully play together, sharing fallen wood-apples. This image highlights the fertility and secure, harmonious nature of Paṇṇaṉ's territory despite it being a dry forest region. The poet warns the bard to hurry before Paṇṇaṉ leaves for war, as his generosity is the only cure for the bard's starving family. The key phrase 'pacippakaip paricil' beautifully frames the gift as a weapon to defeat the bard's ultimate enemy, hunger.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,2.24],[2.24,2.6],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.4],[3.4,3.78],[3.78,4.93],[4.93,6.08],[6.08,6.7],[6.7,7.82],[7.82,8.25],[8.25,8.4],[8.7,8.9],[9.46,9.74],[9.74,10.43],[11.75,12.0],[12.0,12.23],[12.23,12.51],[12.51,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.4],[13.4,14.45],[14.6,14.75],[14.75,15.2],[15.2,15.63],[15.63,16.22],[16.22,17.0],[17.0,17.2],[17.2,17.8],[17.8,18.0],[18.76,19.36],[19.36,19.66],[19.66,20.16],[20.16,20.66],[20.66,20.82],[20.82,21.34],[21.34,21.86],[22.28,22.56]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.34],[1.56,2.0],[2.0,2.44],[2.44,2.8],[2.8,3.4],[3.4,3.8],[3.8,4.67],[5.22,5.63],[5.65,5.79],[5.79,6.0],[6.3,6.9],[6.9,7.38],[7.38,7.85],[8.8,9.0],[9.0,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,11.34],[11.34,11.6],[11.6,12.24],[12.5,12.9],[12.9,13.3],[13.3,13.7],[13.7,14.47],[14.47,15.57],[15.74,16.0],[16.0,16.4],[16.4,17.3],[17.3,17.5],[17.5,18.1],[18.1,18.7],[18.7,19.0],[19.76,20.36],[20.36,20.66],[20.66,21.06],[21.06,21.76],[21.76,21.96],[21.96,23.16],[23.16,23.36],[23.36,24.16]]},"sync":[[["மன்ற","of the common ground"]],[["விளவின்","of the wood-apple tree"]],[["மனை","house"],["வீழ்","fallen"]],[["வெள்ளில்","wood-apple fruit"]],[["கருங்கண்","dark-eyed"]],[["எயிற்றி","hunter woman"]],[["காதல்","beloved"]],[["மகனொடு","with the son"]],[["கான","of the forest"]],[["இரும்பிடி","dark female elephant"]],[["கன்று","calf"],["தலைக்கொள்ளும்","takes"]],[["தலைக்கொள்ளும்","takes"]],[["பெருங்குறும்பு","large stronghold"]],[["உடுத்த","surrounded"]],[["வன்புல","dry-land"]],[["இருக்கை","settlement"]],[["புலாஅல்","flesh-smelling"]],[["அம்பின்","of arrows"]],[["போர்","battle"],["அருங்","difficult"]],[["கடிமிளை","guarded defensive forest"]],[["வலாஅரோனே","he of Vallār town"]],[["வலாஅரோனே","he of Vallār town"]],[["வாய்வாள்","victorious sword"]],[["பண்ணன்","Paṇṇaṉ"]],[["உண்ணா","starving"]],[["வறுங்கடும்பு","impoverished family"]],[["உய்தல்","surviving"]],[["வேண்டின்","if you desire"]],[["இன்னே","right now"]],[["சென்மதி","please go"]],[["நீயே","you yourself"]],[["சென்று","having gone"]],[["அவன்","his"]],[["பகைப்புலம்","enemy land"]],[["படரா","before marching"]],[["அளவை","within the time"]],[["நின்","your"]],[["பசிப்பகை","hunger-enemy"]],[["பரிசில்","gift"]],[["காட்டினை","having shown"]],[["கொளற்கே","to receive"]]]}